{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-05150-00002","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["미국 NBC 기자에게 한 “1월 3일부터 모두 30차례 미국에 전염병 정보와 방역 조치를 통보했다”","네티즌들은 “화 대변인의 발언은 자국민과 미국에 서로 다른 이야기를 했음을 실토한 것”이라고 비난했다"],"reason":"It covers most key points, including the case counts and the Canada statement. It garbles the relation at the end: the netizens, not the spokesperson, are the ones who criticize, and the summary says the spokesperson 'criticized' via the netizens' anger. It also begins by saying 'China expresses praise and support' without naming the countries that actually did so."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["최근 중국 국민의 입국에 검역 강화 등의 조처를 하면서 중국에 이해와 존중을 표시했다","절대다수 국가는 중국의 전염병 대항 조치에 칭찬과 지지를 표시했다"],"reason":"It names China as the actor who strengthened quarantine and expressed understanding of itself, when the source says other countries did so toward China. It also omits the China case counts and the spokesperson controversy."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":4,"utility":2,"evidence":["2월 2일까지 중국에서 신종 코로나바이러스 폐렴 확진자는 1만7205명","미국 질병통제센터(CDC)는 최근 보고에서 미국은 2019~2020년 독감으로"],"reason":"It says China praised and supported itself, which reverses the relation: most countries praised China. It attributes the China case counts to the CDC when the source does not, and it omits the US flu figures and the spokesperson controversy."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["절대다수 국가는 중국의 전염병 대항 조치에 칭찬과 지지를 표시했다","캐나다는 미국을 따라 중국인 및 과거 중국을 경유한 외국인 입국을 막지 않겠다며"],"reason":"It makes China the one who praises and supports, which is the wrong actor. The Canada sentence drops 'will not follow the US in blocking', so it reads as though Canada simply has no grounds, and the US restrictions, the case counts and the controversy are omitted."}}}
